WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:20.046
Tom knew his aunt wanted to catch him in a lie so he said, "Ma'am, I was so hot today that I dumped water from the well on my head.

2
00:00:20.047 --> 00:00:23.005
See, my hair is still wet."

3
00:00:23.006 --> 00:00:28.016
Aunt Polly was annoyed that she had overlooked Tom's wet hair.

4
00:00:28.017 --> 00:00:31.462
"He skipped school again," she thought.

5
00:00:31.463 --> 00:00:38.220
She decided to use her secret weapon; before school each morning she sewed Tom's collar shut with thread.

6
00:00:38.221 --> 00:00:43.064
"Tom, show me your shirt collar," said Aunt Polly sternly.

7
00:00:43.065 --> 00:00:48.707
If he had taken off his shirt to go swimming, she would see the broken thread and know!

8
00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:53.564
Aunt Polly was really surprised because the collar was still sewn shut.

9
00:00:53.565 --> 00:00:57.821
"Tom, I'm sorry I suspected you of skipping school today.

10
00:00:57.822 --> 00:01:01.684
It appears that I was wrong," said Aunt Polly.

11
00:01:01.685 --> 00:01:04.433
Tom accepted her apology gracefully.

12
00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:13.148
He was just about to leave when Sid said, "Didn't you sew Tom's collar with white thread this morning? Look here."

13
00:01:13.149 --> 00:01:18.751
He pointed at Tom's shirt. "Tom's collar is sewn with black thread."

14
00:01:18.752 --> 00:01:27.274
"Why, yes, I did sew it with white thread today," said Aunt Polly thoughtfully, and then her face changed.

15
00:01:27.275 --> 00:01:35.154
It turned red, her glasses slipped to the tip of her nose, and she screamed, "Boy, that's it!"

16
00:01:35.155 --> 00:01:38.249
Tom turned to Sid and said menacingly.

17
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:41.638
"I'll beat you good for that!" he growled.

18
00:01:41.639 --> 00:01:46.012
Not wanting to hear what his punishment would be, he ran out the door.

19
00:01:46.013 --> 00:01:50.344
"I'll have to punish him tomorrow," said Aunt Polly to herself.

20
00:01:50.345 --> 00:01:56.434
"I'll make him work. He hates work, but I've got to teach him a lesson."

21
00:01:56.435 --> 00:02:04.097
Tom sat down under a tree. In the fading light, he examined the two needles he kept under the front collar of his shirt.

22
00:02:04.098 --> 00:02:10.100
One needle had white thread and the other had black.

23
00:02:10.101 --> 00:02:15.993
"Aunt Polly never would have noticed the thread, if it hadn't been for Sid," moaned Tom.

24
00:02:15.994 --> 00:02:21.396
"Darn it. I bet she'll make me work tomorrow, and tomorrow is Saturday."

25
00:02:21.397 --> 00:02:23.617
Tom was in a foul mood.

26
00:02:23.618 --> 00:02:28.872
He spent the rest of the evening planning his revenge on Sid.

27
00:02:28.873 --> 00:02:33.344
The next day Tom stood on the sidewalk with a paint bucket and a brush.

28
00:02:33.345 --> 00:02:35.152
He looked at the fence.

29
00:02:35.153 --> 00:02:41.020
It was ninety feet long and nine feet high, and he had to spend his whole Saturday painting it.

30
00:02:41.021 --> 00:02:44.786
He dipped his brush into the bucket and painted the first plank.

31
00:02:44.787 --> 00:02:52.033
Then he stopped. "This will take forever." He sighed.

32
00:02:52.034 --> 00:02:55.926
Suddenly Tom saw his friend Ben coming down the street.

33
00:02:55.927 --> 00:03:00.682
Tom picked up the brush and began painting again because he had a plan.

34
00:03:00.683 --> 00:03:05.906
Ben walked up to Tom. "Working, huh? I'm going swimming.

35
00:03:05.907 --> 00:03:08.383
Don't you wish you could come?"

36
00:03:08.384 --> 00:03:11.549
"I'm not working," replied Tom.

37
00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:13.981
"Yes, you are," said Ben.

38
00:03:13.982 --> 00:03:19.406
"Well, maybe it is working, but I like it," said Tom.

39
00:03:19.407 --> 00:03:23.805
"What?" shouted Ben. "You like it?"

40
00:03:23.806 --> 00:03:29.850
Tom kept painting, and said, "Boys don't get to paint a fence every day."

41
00:03:29.851 --> 00:03:35.139
Ben watched Tom paint for a while. The fence looked clean and white.

42
00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:40.874
Ben watched some more, and soon he started to think, "Painting looks easy.

43
00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:47.405
Painting looks fun." Before long Ben really wanted to paint too!

44
00:03:47.406 --> 00:03:51.027
"Let me try," he begged Tom.

45
00:03:51.028 --> 00:03:58.513
"No," said Tom. "Aunt Polly told me to do it. She said it was important.

46
00:03:58.514 --> 00:04:05.910
This is the street side of the fence. Only one boy in a thousand has the talent to paint the street side."

47
00:04:05.911 --> 00:04:09.977
Tom paused and pretended to think for a moment.

48
00:04:09.978 --> 00:04:14.582
"Maybe you can do the back side," he said.

49
00:04:14.583 --> 00:04:18.208
"I'll let you have my apple," Ben offered.

50
00:04:18.209 --> 00:04:21.392
Tom looked at Ben, and then he looked at the apple.

51
00:04:21.393 --> 00:04:27.015
He handed Ben the brush. While Ben painted, Tom rested in the shade.

52
00:04:27.016 --> 00:04:31.815
He ate the apple and smiled. His plan had worked.

53
00:04:31.816 --> 00:04:35.005
Soon other boys came and asked to paint too.

54
00:04:35.006 --> 00:04:41.815
By early afternoon both sides of the fence were finished, and Tom's pockets were full of presents.

55
00:04:41.816 --> 00:04:45.427
"May I play now?" Tom called to his aunt.

56
00:04:45.428 --> 00:04:51.397
"You can't be finished already! How much of the fence have you painted?" she asked.

57
00:04:51.398 --> 00:04:54.768
"All of it. Come and see," said Tom.

58
00:04:54.769 --> 00:04:58.692
"Don't you lie to me—," began Aunt Polly.

59
00:04:58.693 --> 00:05:01.921
Just then she spotted the freshly painted fence.

60
00:05:01.922 --> 00:05:07.137
She was so pleased with its clean appearance, she gave Tom a shiny red apple.

61
00:05:07.138 --> 00:05:12.057
Then she sent him off to play.
